OL,3,GNEWSAWhen is a water leak your
OL,4,Aresponsibility?
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in Clevedon said they were
OL,7,F"shocked" to find out they will face
OL,8,Fbills of #5,000 each to repair a pipe
OL,9,Fthat is leaking thousands of litres of
OL,10,Fwater a day.
OL,12,FBristol Water said the leak, which has
OL,13,Fbeen ongoing for more than a year, is
OL,14,Fon a private supply pipe, meaning the
OL,15,Fowners are responsible for fixing it.
OL,17,FBut how do you know whether a leak is
OL,18,Fdown to you to fix, or your water
OL,19,Fcompany?
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
