OL,3,GNEWSAWhen is a water leak your
OL,4,Aresponsibility?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHomeowners are responsible for
OL,7,Fmaintaining all pipes on their
OL,8,Fproperty, which includes not only
OL,9,Finternal plumbing, but also the supply
OL,10,Fpipes connecting a home to the mains.
